  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c3b4498ddca048c4aad90d8efe6805e2, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 136950562816
    m_Localized: Finally...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137013477376
    m_Localized: It's my first day running the shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137013477377
    m_Localized: I'm so nervous...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137013477378
    m_Localized: Grandma!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137013477379
    m_Localized: Deunhae
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137013477380
    m_Localized: 'You''ve worked so hard.

      You''ve built yourself quite a fine
      shop.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137013477381
    m_Localized: 'They said the rabbit who handled the remodeling was renowned for
      their skill. It seems that was no exaggeration.

      The outside of the shop
      looks quite splendid.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137013477382
    m_Localized: Would you show me around inside?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137013477383
    m_Localized: 'You''ve chosen a fine spot for the field, too!

      I''m glad
      to see the soil has good energy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137013477384
    m_Localized: 'Oh, I hear the villagers have been asking for sweet pumpkin seolgi
      lately.

      Wouldn''t it be wise to harvest plenty of sweet pumpkins in
      advance?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137013477385
    m_Localized: 'Good. Seeing you handle the harvest so capably puts my mind at
      ease.

      But harvesting is not the end of it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137013477386
    m_Localized: 'To bring out its true flavor, you must grind the sweet pumpkin
      into powder and mix it into the dough.

      You haven''t forgotten how, have
      you?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 137013477387
    m_Localized: 'Let us go to the mill together, so you can refresh your memory
      on how to turn it into powder.

      We had best be on our way.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4308581698748416
    m_Localized: Oh my, what a neat and tidy little shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4308581761662976
    m_Localized: 'It feels like only yesterday you were learning by my side...

      And
      now you''ve grown into such a fine shopkeeper...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4308581761662977
    m_Localized: 'Your first customer will be here soon. Are you all ready?

      I
      do worry you may have forgotten what you learned.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4308581761662978
    m_Localized: 'Well then, let me see whether your skills have grown rusty...

      I''ll
      be your very first customer.

      Would you make me a rice cake?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4308581761662979
    m_Localized: ...Now then, for your first one...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4308581761662980
    m_Localized: "A precious rice cake that symbolizes our land's tradition and purity.\nWhen
      finely sifted non-glutinous rice flour is steamed, it turns soft and snowy\u2014a
      true delight..."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4308581761662981
    m_Localized: Baekseolgi, please.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4308581761662982
    m_Localized: 'Now, begin by sifting the rice flour.

      You haven''t forgotten
      the rhythm I taught you, have you?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4308581761662983
    m_Localized: 'Mm, your touch hasn''t left you.

      What a lovely rice cake
      you''ve made.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4308581761662984
    m_Localized: '(Takes a bite, eyes widening)

      ...Oh my! Your skill grows
      deeper by the day.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4308581761662985
    m_Localized: 'Well done.

      From now on, keep a close eye on the seolgi as
      it steams, and don''t let your nerves get the better of you.

      With your
      skill, you''ll do just fine.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4308581761662986
    m_Localized: By the way, you said you'd grow your own ingredients. How is the
      farming coming along?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4308581761662987
    m_Localized: The care you put into tending the fields finds its way into the
      flavor of your treats. Come, let us take a look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312640673529856
    m_Localized: Garam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312640681918464
    m_Localized: Yoonseul
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312640681918465
    m_Localized: 'Oh, hello!

      You''re the owner of the treat shop next door,
      right?

      It''s so nice to meet you!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312640681918466
    m_Localized: (Silently bows.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312640681918467
    m_Localized: I see you've brought a sweet pumpkin. You must be here to have it
      ground into flour!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312640681918468
    m_Localized: '...(Slowly points toward the mortar)

      This way, please.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312640681918469
    m_Localized: 'I hear that fellow is very skilled with his hands.

      Go on
      over to the mortar.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312640681918470
    m_Localized: Hand it over... I'll grind it into flour for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312640681918471
    m_Localized: It's... all done.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312640681918472
    m_Localized: 'Now, let me see...

      Mm, it''s been ground very finely. Good.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312640681918473
    m_Localized: 'Garam may work with a rough hand, but the results are always dependable.

      The
      texture is just right for making seolgi.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312640681918474
    m_Localized: 'Oh, yes. I hear this mill not only processes flour,

      but
      also sells all sorts of ingredients needed for making treats.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312640681918475
    m_Localized: Why don't you go see Yoonseul as well?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312640681918476
    m_Localized: When it comes to making treats, nothing beats what we sell here
      at the mill!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312640681918477
    m_Localized: "We sell all sorts of things\u2014glutinous rice flour, soybean
      flour, malt, and more!\nBut today's not a delivery day, so I can't show you
      any right now."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312640681918478
    m_Localized: 'If you ever need something later, come by anytime!

      We''ll
      make sure you can always find what you''re looking for!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4312640681918479
    m_Localized: 'Now that we''ve ground the sweet pumpkin into fine flour,

      let''s
      head back to the shop and make sweet pumpkin seolgi.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410112
    m_Localized: Farming
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410113
    m_Localized: Head to the field below the shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410114
    m_Localized: Harvest Sweet Pumpkins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410115
    m_Localized: Open the seed box on the right side of the field.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410116
    m_Localized: Harvest Sweet Pumpkins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410117
    m_Localized: 'Click the sweet pumpkin seed packet to pick it up.

      You have
      an unlimited supply of seeds.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410118
    m_Localized: Harvest Sweet Pumpkins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410119
    m_Localized: 'While holding the packet, click the field

      to plant sweet
      pumpkin seeds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410120
    m_Localized: Harvest Sweet Pumpkins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410121
    m_Localized: 'Once you have finished planting the seeds,

      open the box
      again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410122
    m_Localized: Harvest Sweet Pumpkins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410123
    m_Localized: 'Click the seed slot or press SPACE

      to return the seeds.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410124
    m_Localized: Harvest Sweet Pumpkins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410125
    m_Localized: Press E to pick up the watering can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410126
    m_Localized: Harvest Sweet Pumpkins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410127
    m_Localized: 'While holding the watering can,

      click the field to water
      it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410128
    m_Localized: Harvest Sweet Pumpkins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410129
    m_Localized: 'Water each seed once.

      The crop grows through three stages.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410130
    m_Localized: Harvest Sweet Pumpkins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410131
    m_Localized: 'Return the empty watering can

      to its original place.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410132
    m_Localized: Harvest Sweet Pumpkins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410133
    m_Localized: 'Click the fully grown crop to harvest it.

      You can check
      harvested crops in your inventory.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410134
    m_Localized: To the Mill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410135
    m_Localized: 'Head to the mill

      to process the harvested crop.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410136
    m_Localized: Make Baekseolgi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410137
    m_Localized: 'Open the storage and click the rice flour

      to take it out.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410138
    m_Localized: Make Baekseolgi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410139
    m_Localized: 'Press E again

      to close the storage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410140
    m_Localized: Sifting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410141
    m_Localized: 'Press E in front of the workstation

      to place the ingredient
      you are holding.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410142
    m_Localized: Sifting
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410143
    m_Localized: 'Press SPACE in front of the workstation

      to start crafting.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410144
    m_Localized: Pick Up Ingredient
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410145
    m_Localized: 'Press E again in front of the workstation

      to collect the
      finished ingredient.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410146
    m_Localized: Add Flour
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410147
    m_Localized: 'Add the sifted rice flour

      to the dough workstation.

      You
      can carry only one ingredient at a time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410148
    m_Localized: Get Water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410149
    m_Localized: You can collect water from the sink at any time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410150
    m_Localized: Get Water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410151
    m_Localized: 'Press E again in front of the sink

      to collect water.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410152
    m_Localized: Add Water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410153
    m_Localized: 'Add the water.

      A workstation can hold up to four ingredients.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410154
    m_Localized: Knead Dough
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410155
    m_Localized: Knead the water and rice flour together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410156
    m_Localized: Steam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410157
    m_Localized: 'Place the rice dough in the steamer and steam it

      to make
      Baekseolgi.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410158
    m_Localized: Serve
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410159
    m_Localized: Serve the finished treat to the customer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410160
    m_Localized: Check the Next Treat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410161
    m_Localized: 'Now, let''s make the next treat.

      [Click the Guidebook]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410162
    m_Localized: Make Sweet Pumpkin Seolgi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410163
    m_Localized: 'Check the Sweet Pumpkin Seolgi recipe.

      [Close the Guidebook
      after checking]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410164
    m_Localized: Farming
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410165
    m_Localized: 'Leave the shop

      to harvest sweet pumpkins.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410166
    m_Localized: The Mill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410167
    m_Localized: Talk to the rabbit at the mortar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410168
    m_Localized: Select a Crop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410169
    m_Localized: 'Click the left slot to add a harvested crop.

      Click it again
      to return it to your inventory.

      [Add the sweet pumpkin]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410170
    m_Localized: Make Flour
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410171
    m_Localized: 'Press the check button below

      to turn the selected crop into
      flour.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410172
    m_Localized: Flour Ready
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410173
    m_Localized: 'You received sweet pumpkin flour.

      [Close the pop-up]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410174
    m_Localized: Shopping
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410175
    m_Localized: Talk to Yoonseul at the counter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410176
    m_Localized: Shopping
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4325063736410177
    m_Localized: 'Stock updates when you level up

      and unlock a new treat.

      [Close
      the shop window]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4330711777787904
    m_Localized: Open Storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4330711777787905
    m_Localized: Close Storage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4330711777787906
    m_Localized: Craft
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4330711777787907
    m_Localized: Pick Up
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4330711777787908
    m_Localized: Add Ingredient
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4330711777787909
    m_Localized: Get Water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4336456611119104
    m_Localized: Leave Shop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028220334080
    m_Localized: Make Sweet Pumpkin Seolgi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803072
    m_Localized: 'Open the storage and click the sweet pumpkin flour

      to take
      it out.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803073
    m_Localized: Make Sweet Pumpkin Seolgi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803074
    m_Localized: 'Press E again

      to close the storage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803075
    m_Localized: Add Flour
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803076
    m_Localized: 'Add the sweet pumpkin flour directly

      to the dough workstation
      without sifting it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803077
    m_Localized: Get Water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803078
    m_Localized: You can collect water from the sink at any time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803079
    m_Localized: Get Water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803080
    m_Localized: 'Press E again in front of the sink

      to collect water.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803081
    m_Localized: Add Water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803082
    m_Localized: Add the water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803083
    m_Localized: Knead Dough
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803084
    m_Localized: Knead the water and sweet pumpkin flour together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803085
    m_Localized: Knead Dough
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803086
    m_Localized: 'Press E

      to take out the dough.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803087
    m_Localized: Steam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803088
    m_Localized: 'Place the sweet pumpkin dough in the steamer

      and steam it
      to make Sweet Pumpkin Seolgi.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803089
    m_Localized: Steam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803090
    m_Localized: 'Press E

      to take out the Sweet Pumpkin Seolgi.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803091
    m_Localized: Serve
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4378028316803092
    m_Localized: Serve the finished treat to the customer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4380089859162112
    m_Localized: "Now, make it just as you made the Baekseolgi earlier\u2014only
      use sweet pumpkin flour instead.\nSimple enough, isn't it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4380089859162113
    m_Localized: Go on, make some Sweet Pumpkin Seolgi and bring it to me for a taste.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4380089859162114
    m_Localized: Well, well. You're getting quite good at making Sweet Pumpkin Seolgi,
      too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4380089859162115
    m_Localized: (Takes a bite of the Sweet Pumpkin Seolgi.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4380089859162116
    m_Localized: ...It seems you may be more skilled than I am now. You must have
      practiced hard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4380089859162117
    m_Localized: 'Good. I have nothing left to worry about.

      Now, why don''t
      you try running the shop on your own?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4380089859162118
    m_Localized: I'll always be cheering you on. I need to rest for a little while
      beneath the Moon Tree.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5166739266715648
    m_Localized: Tutorial
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5166978040053760
    m_Localized: 'Use the WASD keys to move

      and enter the shop.

      (You
      can also use the arrow keys.)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6480294967517184
    m_Localized: Harvest Sweet Pumpkins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6480913719631872
    m_Localized: Press E again to close the box
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
